#~ msgid ""
#~ "Couplings are all-to-all: every "
#~ "two-qubit term is placed on each "
#~ "pair i < j, so ``nqubits=3`` "
#~ "couples ``(0, 1)``, ``(0, 2)`` and "
#~ "``(1, 2)``. Coefficients are used "
#~ "exactly as given, with no implicit "
#~ "sign convention, so pass a negative "
#~ "value for a ferromagnetic coupling. The"
#~ " fields default to zero and are "
#~ "left out entirely unless you ask "
#~ "for them, while the couplings of "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.xy` and "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.heisenberg` "
#~ "default to ``xx_coefficient``, so that "
#~ "``heisenberg(nqubits, xx_coefficient=J)`` is the "
#~ "isotropic XXX model and setting "
#~ "``zz_coefficient`` alone gives the XXZ "
#~ "model:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Els acoblaments són de tots amb "
#~ "tots: cada terme de dos qubits es"
#~ " col·loca a cada parell i < j,"
#~ " de manera que ``nqubits=3`` acobla "
#~ "``(0, 1)``, ``(0, 2)`` i ``(1, "
#~ "2)``. Els coeficients s'utilitzen exactament"
#~ " tal com es donen, sense cap "
#~ "conveni de signe implícit, de manera "
#~ "que cal passar un valor negatiu "
#~ "per a un acoblament ferromagnètic. Els"
#~ " camps valen zero per defecte i "
#~ "s'ometen del tot si no es demanen,"
#~ " mentre que els acoblaments de "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.xy` i "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.heisenberg` "
#~ "prenen per defecte el valor de "
#~ "``xx_coefficient``, de manera que "
#~ "``heisenberg(nqubits, xx_coefficient=J)`` és el "
#~ "model XXX isòtrop i fixar només "
#~ "``zz_coefficient`` dóna el model XXZ:"

#~ msgid "Lattice geometries"
#~ msgstr "Geometries de xarxa"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The two exceptions to the all-"
#~ "to-all rule are "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.ising_chain` and"
#~ " :meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.ising_grid`, "
#~ "which couple nearest neighbours only. A"
#~ " chain couples adjacent qubits along "
#~ "a line, while a grid takes "
#~ "``rows`` and ``columns`` instead of "
#~ "``nqubits`` and numbers its ``rows * "
#~ "columns`` qubits in row-major order, "
#~ "coupling each one to its neighbour "
#~ "to the right and below:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Les dues excepcions a la regla de"
#~ " tots amb tots són "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.ising_chain` i"
#~ " :meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.ising_grid`, "
#~ "que acoblen només els primers veïns. "
#~ "Una cadena acobla qubits adjacents al"
#~ " llarg d'una línia, mentre que una"
#~ " xarxa pren ``rows`` i ``columns`` en"
#~ " lloc de ``nqubits`` i numera els "
#~ "seus ``rows * columns`` qubits per "
#~ "files, acoblant cadascun amb el seu "
#~ "veí de la dreta i amb el de"
#~ " sota:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Passing ``periodic=True`` closes the chain "
#~ "into a ring, or the grid into "
#~ "a torus, by coupling each edge "
#~ "back to the opposite one. Wrapping "
#~ "is skipped along any direction shorter"
#~ " than 3 sites, where the extra "
#~ "bond would simply duplicate one the "
#~ "open lattice already has."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Passar ``periodic=True`` tanca la cadena "
#~ "en un anell, o la xarxa en "
#~ "un torus, acoblant cada vora amb "
#~ "la contrària. El tancament s'omet en "
#~ "qualsevol direcció de menys de 3 "
#~ "llocs, on l'enllaç addicional simplement "
#~ "duplicaria un que la xarxa oberta "
#~ "ja té."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Note that this mutates the Hamiltonian"
#~ " and returns it, in the same "
#~ "way as "
#~ ":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.simplify`, so "
#~ "copy it first if you need to "
#~ "keep the original coefficients."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tingueu en compte que això modifica "
#~ "el Hamiltonià i el retorna, igual "
#~ "que :meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.simplify`,"
#~ " de manera que cal copiar-lo "
#~ "abans si necessiteu conservar els "
#~ "coeficients originals."

